game.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_17f31391481c569bdb6691e9feb3fc21.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":true,"tags":[{"name":"Shield","rgb":"89,168,111"}]},{"id":6410,"name":"Contract: Soul Steal","description":"Aldous enhances his next Basic Attack to deal 200 (+100% Total Physical Attack) (+ 3 per Soul Steal stack) Physical Damage.\n\nKilling a siege minion with this attack grants 12 Soul Steal stacks; killing any other non-hero unit grants 5 stacks. Hitting an enemy hero grants an extra 5 stack(s), while killing one grants 12 (up to 1000 stacks).\n\nThis attack deals 300% extra Base Damage to minions and creeps. Aldous also gains 6 stack(s) when allied units eliminate a nearby enemy siege minion, and 2 stack(s) when they eliminate any other nearby non-hero unit.\n\nAldous gains 20% Movement Speed while moving toward enemy heroes during this skill.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_39d2e1dab8a446d9d5adb5f4b564505c.png","video":null,"cd":4.0,"cost":45.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Damage","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":6420,"name":"Contract: Explosion","description":"Aldous assumes a defensive stance, gaining 30% Damage Reduction for 2s or until canceled.\nHe then deals 200 (+20% Total Physical Attack)-400 (+40% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to nearby enemies and stuns them for 0.5-1s (scales with defensive stance duration).","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_523832f81d6deeaf65b1f9a0a4735591.png","video":null,"cd":12.0,"cost":80.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"},{"name":"CC","rgb":"205,93,109"}]},{"id":6430,"name":"Contract: Chase Fate","description":"Aldous gains vision of all enemy heroes for 5s.\nUse Again: During this time, he dashes toward an enemy hero, dealing 250 (+ 8% target's ) Physical Damage and knocking the target back for 1s.\nAldo